  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Next\n\n- A missing required handler parameter (`Required parameter \"string query\" was not provided from query string.`) is answered with HTTP 400 and `ValidationProblemDetailsExtended` (error details for the parameter, under its bound name, e.g. `[FromHeader(Name = \"x-tenant\")]`) instead of HTTP 500. With the Request Delegate Generator this also covers an empty value (`?query=`) of a required `string` parameter.\n- New `IHideErrorResponseInterceptor` (Contracts): replace the decision whether the error details are hidden, e.g. to show internal error details to specific users. Exactly one interceptor (no chain); the default keeps the configured `ShowExceptionDetailsOnErrorCodeRanges` decision.\n- No functional changes: the code follows the repository's code rules (formatting only).\n- Package metadata: the repository url points to the git repository, the debugger steps into the sources (SourceLink, symbol package .snupkg), and these release notes are shown on NuGet. Authors and company are Siemens AG, every package has its own description and tags.",
